    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16273" root="رق" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُقٌّ</span></b>  <i>Shallow,</i> applied to water; or <i>shallow water;</i>
(↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَآءٌ رَقِيقٌ</span></b> ; IDrd, K, TA;) <i>not copious,</i> or <i>not
abundant;</i> (IDrd, TA;) in a sea, or great river,
or in a valley; (IDrd, K, TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَقٌّ</span></b> ;

(K;) and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُقَارِقٌ</span></b> . (IDrd, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَقَاقٌ</span>.

